;-------------------------------------------------
;育児イベント食事時。
;子ども空腹度が120以上、起床時と時間経過？
;幼少期以降の食事はIF GROUPMATCH(SELECTCOM, 414, 415, 610, 615, 617)
;つまり、「食事を取る」「食事をふるまう」「食事（デート）」「お弁当を食べる」「甘味屋へ誘う」実行時
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EVENT_K76_CHILD_RAISING_食事(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
#DIMS 子供の名前
子供の名前 = %CHILDNAME:76:(TALENT:76:育児中)%
IF ARGS == "授乳"
	PRINTFORML 「Look, here's your boobies! Drink up, now!」
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% sucks Komachi's breast milk at a heady clip.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Ahaha, you were crying so loud a bit ago, you must've been real hungry!」
	PRINTFORML 「Hmmー, I see, it's really tasty isn't it, %子供の名前%? Yes yes, that's right♪」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi speaks to %子供の名前% in a soft, loving voice.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「If you keep drinking like this, you'll grow up big and strong in no time, won'tcha♪」
	PRINTFORMDL Once \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? she # he\@'s finished suckling, Komachi hands %子供の名前% to you and gently pat \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@ on the back.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Before long, %子供の名前% lets out a massive burp you'd never expect from such an adorable body.
	PRINTFORML 「Bahahaha♪ That was a good burp, %子供の名前%! I see you're just like your daddy～」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL It feels weird to be praised for your burping, but nevertheless you feel like a proud father.
	PRINTW 
ELSEIF ARGS == "離乳食"
	PRINTFORML 「Come onー, %子供の名前%! Open wide for the airplane!」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi brings a spoonful of rice and daikon puree to %子供の名前%'s mouth.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% opens \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ small mouth as wide as possible and happily takes the spoon inside.
	PRINTFORML 「Nomnomnomnomnom, now! Good job!」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Grinning happily, Komachi takes a little break before she feeds %子供の名前% a second helping.
	PRINTFORML 「Do you like vegetables? Yes yes, they're so tasty, aren't they?～」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Come on, you try it too! %子供の名前% would be happy, you know?～」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi hands you the jar of baby food.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL You carefully bring a spoonful to the mouth of your child as Komachi holds \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@.
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% opens \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ mouth wide and takes it just as easily as when Komachi was feeding \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「You look so happy, daddy! With that caring look on your face♪」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi can't help but chuckle as she watches you happily feeding your child.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi's the one doing all the work, making the baby food from scratch. Honestly you're getting the easy part just feeding \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@.
	PRINTFORMDL You bow your head at Komachi, acknowledging her efforts.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「I mean, I don't put that much thought into making more varieties...」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi scratches her head as she laughs in embarrassment.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Usually it's much more difficult than this, %子供の名前% just plays with it and never eats.」
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% spits out the food that was in their mouth.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Ah, there it is.」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi bursts into laughter at your flustered face...
	PRINTW 
ELSEIF ARGS == "幼少期"
	PRINTFORML 「%子供の名前%, did you wash your hands? Properly?」
	PRINTFORML 「Okay then, now it's time to say thanks for the food!」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Matching Komachi's actions, you and %子供の名前% clap their hands together and bow your heads.
	PRINTFORML 「Make sure you chew all the way! I don't want you to end up with a weak jaw!」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Hey, there's still some vegetables left. Do you know what happens when there's still food on the plate?」
	;ed. note: もったいないお化け is a reference to a popular anti-waste campaign in Japan
	PRINTFORML 「That's right, the "Don't Waste Ghost" will come for you!」
	PRINTFORML 「Oh, you ate it! What a good job♪」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% looks happy after being praised by Komachi.
	PRINTW 
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 
ENDIF

;-------------------------------------------------
;育児イベント入浴
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EVENT_K76_CHILD_RAISING_BATH(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
#DIMS 子供の名前
子供の名前 = %CHILDNAME:76:(TALENT:76:育児中)%
IF ARGS == "幼児期"
	PRINTFORML 「Okay, shut your eyes, real tight! Here comes the big splashー!」
	PRINTFORMDL After making sure that %子供の名前%'s eyes are closed and covered with \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ hands for good measure, Komachi pours water atop \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ head.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Wipe your face with your hands now, can you open your eyes?」
	PRINTFORMDL It seems simple from an adult's point of view, but for a child, it's all still a new experience.
	PRINTFORMDL You have no memory from when you were this young, but you wonder if your mother taught you the same way...
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Here, %CALLNAME:MASTER%! Take them.」
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi hands %子供の名前% over to you, and you hold \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@ tight so you don't drop \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@ in the tub.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% seems at ease when you settle \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@ in your lap, and \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@ lets out little shrieks of pleasure as \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@ plays by slapping the water.
	PRINTFORML 「Ahh, kids always know how to have fun with the littlest of things, don't they♪」
	PRINTFORMDL Thinking about it, you agree with Komachi.
	PRINTW 
ELSEIF ARGS == "幼少期"
	PRINTFORML 「Hey nowー! You're not gonna get all the dirt of if you wash so sloppily! Do it properly, okay?」
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% clearly wants to just speed through the bath and get back to playing, so Komachi catches \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? him # her\@ and begins to scrub.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Maybe embarrassed or just ticklish, %子供の名前% struggles and squirms in her gasp, but to no avail.
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi's still a shinigami after all, and once she gets a proper pin %子供の名前% immediately turns as meek as a kitten.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「Alright, now you're good and clean. That's how you take a proper bath!」
	PRINTFORML 「——Hey, don't run off straight away! Ah, geeze! If you don't dry off properly, you'll catch a cold!」
	PRINTW 
	;ed. note: "crow's bath" is a Japanese idiom that means a short/perfunctory bath. I'm not aware of an equivalent in English so I just directly translated it.
	PRINTFORMDL Ah, so this is what they mean by a "crow's bath". You hurry after %子供の名前% before \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@ can manage to get away...
	PRINTW 
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「I'm so happy♪ %子供の名前% hasn't been getting in the bath together with me very much these days!」
	PRINTFORML 「What're you so embarrassed about? Y'know, not so long ago you used to cling to these boobies every day.」
	PRINTFORML 「You're too old for that now? Haah, %子供の名前%'s already at that age, huh... How much I'll miss those days...」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL A somewhat rare occurrence now, %子供の名前% agreed to take a bath with you and Komachi as a family.
	PRINTFORMDL You feel a tinge of loneliness knowing the day for %子供の名前% to leave the nest is drawing ever nearer...
	PRINTW 
ENDIF

