	PRINTFORML 
ENDIF

;-------------------------------------------------
;育児イベント川の字でおやすみ
;CFLAG:出産経過日 >= CHILD_よちよち

;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EVENT_K76_CHILD_RAISING_OYASUMI(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
#DIMS 子供の名前
子供の名前 = %CHILDNAME:76:(TALENT:76:育児中)%
PRINTFORML 「Okayー, time for bed! Come get in the futonー!」
PRINTFORMDL You both peek at %子供の名前%'s sleeping face, already peacefully asleep in the middle of the futon.
PRINTW 
PRINTFORML 「Ahhh～! I'll never get it, how come a sleeping child is just so cute...」
PRINTFORML 「It takes so much work, and there are times when they don't listen at all, and can be a real handful, but...」
PRINTFORML 「When I look at %子供の名前%'s face, all I can think is "I'm looking forwards to tomorrow!" It's all worth it in the end, y'know?」
PRINTW 
PRINTFORMDL As she gently brushes %子供の名前%'s hair out of \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ face, and you marvel at how Komachi looks like a mother through and through.
PRINTFORML 「Thank you for being born to me, %子供の名前%...」
CALL HPH_PRINT,@"「You're our treasure...HPH」","L"
PRINTW 
PRINTFORMDL Comfy in bed, you and Komachi amuse yourselves talking about adult things for a while as %子供の名前% sleeps on betwixt you.
PRINTW 

;-------------------------------------------------
;育児イベント玩具
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EVENT_K76_CHILD_RAISING_TOY(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
#DIMS 子供の名前
子供の名前 = %CHILDNAME:76:(TALENT:76:育児中)%
;IF CFLAG:LOCAL:出産経過日 < CHILD_語彙
IF ARGS == "幼児期"
	PRINTFORML 「%子供の名前%, guess what...! Your dad made you a toy!」
	PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% seems to be completely engrossed in playing with your handmade toy.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORML 「%HE_SHE(MASTER)% worked real hard to make it, y'know. Say thank you now, okay!」
	PRINTFORMDL You say you should be thanking her, instead. Komachi shyly grins back at you.
	PRINTW 
;IF INRANGE(CFLAG:LOCAL:出産経過日, CHILD_語彙, CHILD_自立前 -1)
ELSEIF ARGS == "幼少期"
	IF ABL:MASTER:技巧 >= 5
		PRINTFORML 「%子供の名前%, what is it?」
		PRINTFORMDL Intrigued, Komachi stares at the toy %子供の名前% has been playing with.
		PRINTW 
		PRINTFORMW 「Eh, it's a "Thermonuclear Titan Hisoutensoku"?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It transforms?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It can merge and separate?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It even says its special moves?」
		PRINTFORMW 「That sounds pretty amazing!」
		PRINTW 
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDL %子供の名前% is having fun with the wooden toy you made.
		PRINTFORMDL It's a toy that looks like a little wheeled figurine, and it makes a clattering sound as it rolls.
		PRINTW 
		PRINTFORML 「It's pretty well made, isn't it?」
		PRINTFORMDL Komachi rests her chin in her hands while she watches %子供の名前% play.
		PRINTW 
		PRINTFORML 「I tried making something like that too, but it didn't turn out well... I kinda felt like a failure of a parent, y'know?」
		PRINTFORML 「I don't think there's many parents out there who can do something as impressive as make toys like that.」
		PRINTW 
		PRINTFORML 「Even when %子供の名前% grows up and stops playing with toys...」
		PRINTFORML 「I bet they'll always remember the present they got, and your hard work to make it.」
		PRINTW 
	ENDIF
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 
ENDIF

