ELSEIF ARGS == "幼少期"
	PRINTFORML 「%子供の名前%, don't go too far by yourself!」
	PRINTFORML 「Play where mom and dad can see you, okay?」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi does her best to hammer home the point, but %子供の名前%'s so absorbed in \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? his # her\@ play you doubt \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@ actually listened.
	PRINTFORMDL Komachi seems to be fully aware of this, because she follows %子供の名前% around like a hawk, just as you do.
	PRINTW 
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「%子供の名前% has grown so much, hasn't \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@...」
	PRINTFORML 「Before I knew it, \@ CHILD_SEX:76:(LOCAL:1) == 1 ? he # she\@'s gone and grown taller than me! How time flies...」
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDL Although %子供の名前% isn't constantly clingy with Komachi anymore, they're still very close.
	PRINTFORMDL There isn't a doubt in your mind that %子供の名前% would take care of Komachi, if she needed it.
	PRINTFORMDL Then again, Komachi will probably end up living the longest out of all of you...
	PRINTW 
ENDIF

